Conley standard errors in OLS (Ordinary Least Squares) and 2SLS (Two-Stage Least Squares) Use spatial_reg With STATA 19
----------------------

Description
-----------

^spatial_reg^ Conley standard errors in OLS (Ordinary Least Squares) and 2SLS (Two-Stage Least Squares) Use spatial_reg With STATA 19.
     
^Note:^ Requires spatial_reg.ado by Olah Data Semarang

Examples
--------

 . ^qui reg spatial_reg spatial_reg_1^
 . ^spatial_reg spatial_reg spatial_reg_1 spatial_reg_2, indexvar(indexvar) distcutoff(50) small diprog^
 . ^qui ivregress 2sls spatial_reg (spatial_reg_1 = spatial_reg_3)^
 . ^spatial_reg spatial_reg spatial_reg_2 (spatial_reg_1 = spatial_reg_3), indexvar(indexvar) distcutoff(50) small diprog^

